async function openHotelDetail(id,listSheet){try{const x=await api('/mini/hotel',{bookingId:b().id,hotelId:id});state.hotelDetail=x.hotel;state.hotelCategories=x.categories||[];listSheet.remove();const h=state.hotelDetail,imgs=Array.isArray(h.images)?h.images.slice(0,8):[],rooms=Array.isArray(h.rooms)?h.rooms:[],n=sheet('<div class="sheet-head"><div><h2>'+esc(h.name)+'</h2><div class="updates" style="margin-top:4px">'+esc(h.city||'')+'</div></div><button class="sheet-close" data-close>'+ci('back')+'</button></div>'+(imgs.length?'<div class="gallery">'+imgs.map(i=>'<img src="'+esc(i.url)+'" alt="">').join('')+'</div>':'')+'<div class="detail-card" style="margin-bottom:14px">'+(h.address?summaryRow('Address',h.address):'')+(h.stars?summaryRow('Stars',String(h.stars)+'★'):'')+(h.rating?summaryRow('Rating',String(h.rating)):'')+'</div><div class="section-head"><h2>'+esc(t().rooms)+'</h2></div><div id="rooms"></div>');n.querySelector('[data-close]').onclick=()=>{n.remove();openHotels(state.hotelRole)};const rb=n.querySelector('#rooms');const categoryCards=state.hotelCategories.map(c=>'<div class="room-option"><h4>'+esc(c.displayName)+'</h4><p>'+esc(c.bedConfiguration||'')+(c.maxGuests?' · '+esc(String(c.maxGuests))+' guests':'')+'</p><button class="btn primary" data-cat="'+esc(c.id)+'">'+esc(t().select)+'</button></div>').join('');const roomCards=rooms.map(r=>'<div class="room-option"><h4>'+esc(r.name)+'</h4><p>'+esc(r.beds||'')+(r.sizeM2?' · '+esc(String(r.sizeM2))+' m²':'')+(r.maxGuests?' · '+esc(String(r.maxGuests))+' guests':'')+'</p><button class="btn primary" data-room="'+esc(r.id)+'">'+esc(t().select)+'</button></div>').join('');rb.innerHTML=categoryCards+roomCards+((!categoryCards&&!roomCards)?'<button class="btn primary" data-no-room>'+esc(t().select)+'</button>':'');rb.querySelectorAll('[data-cat]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>saveHotel(id,null,e.dataset.cat,n));rb.querySelectorAll('[data-room]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>saveHotel(id,e.dataset.room,null,n));const nr=rb.querySelector('[data-no-room]');if(nr)nr.onclick=()=>saveHotel(id,null,null,n)}catch(e){toast(e.message||'Error')}}
async function saveHotel(hotelId,roomId,categoryId,n){await mutate('hotel',{role:state.hotelRole,hotelId:hotelId,roomId:roomId,categoryId:categoryId});n.remove();state.view='detail';render()}
async function api(path,payload){const r=await fetch(path,{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.assign({initData:tg&&tg.initData||''},payload||{}))});const x=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(x.error||'REQUEST_FAILED');return x}
async function mutate(action,payload){const x=await api('/mini/action',{bookingId:b().id,action:action,payload:payload});toast(t().saved);await load(false);return x}
async function toggleSetting(key,el){const before=el.classList.contains('on');el.classList.toggle('on');try{await mutate('customization',{[key]:!before})}catch{el.classList.toggle('on')}}
function toast(s){const e=$('#toast');e.textContent=s;e.classList.remove('hidden');setTimeout(()=>e.classList.add('hidden'),2100)}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>{state.panel=e.dataset.panel;haptic();render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-scope]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>{state.scope=e.dataset.scope;state.current=null;haptic();render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-act]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>action(e.dataset.act));document.querySelectorAll('[data-expand]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>{const box=document.getElementById('more-'+e.dataset.expand);box.classList.toggle('hidden');e.querySelector('span').textContent=box.classList.contains('hidden')?t().expand:t().collapse});document.querySelectorAll('[data-toggle]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>toggleSetting(e.dataset.toggle,e));document.querySelectorAll('[data-hotel-role]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>openHotels(e.dataset.hotelRole))}
